{"id":"n38882-1-9","stage":2,"title":"나비 · 蝴蝶","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n38882-1-9-1","ko":"엄마, 우리 집 마당에도 나비가 많이 날아들었으면 좋겠어요.","zh":"妈妈，我希望我们家的院子里也能有好多蝴蝶飞来。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"엄마,","meaning":"妈妈","explanation":"엄마：妈妈","readings":[{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67098","senseId":"1","lemma":"엄마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}},{"text":"우리","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}},{"text":"집","meaning":"房子，窝，巢","explanation":"집：房子，窝，巢","readings":[{"term":"집","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71358","senseId":"1","lemma":"집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"집","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3"}},{"text":"마당에도","meaning":"院子，庭院","explanation":"마당：院子，庭院；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"마당","audio":"/audio/bcf71a239bbaaf8d1e52.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15687","senseId":"1","lemma":"마당","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"마당에도","audio":"/audio/809d18d94d853a65ccdc.mp3"}},{"text":"나비가","meaning":"蝴蝶","explanation":"나비：蝴蝶；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"나비","audio":"/audio/2cb37f504898faa6fd3f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"38882","senseId":"1","lemma":"나비","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나비가","audio":"/audio/95b4707e6e4e446c92e3.mp3"}},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}},{"text":"날아들었으면","meaning":"飞来，飞进","explanation":"날아들다：飞来，飞进；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；으면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"날아들다","audio":"/audio/6d5224f45d00d6a1d8c0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"40855","senseId":"1","lemma":"날아들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"날아들었으면","audio":"/audio/4f1b50e280c743b74ad2.mp3"}},{"text":"좋겠어요.","meaning":"喜爱，喜欢","explanation":"좋다：喜爱，喜欢；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"10","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋겠어요","audio":"/audio/3b8ae824a2c33a5f4527.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"9498f9014908e289","term":"엄마","zh":"妈妈","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3","entryId":"67098","definition":"在非正式场合用于指称或称呼母亲。","pronunciation":["엄마"]},{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们，咱们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己和听话人在内的一些人。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"99cf116bb12cf106","term":"집","zh":"房子，窝，巢","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3","entryId":"71358","definition":"人或动物为了遮寒挡暑等，进里面生活而盖的建筑物。","pronunciation":["집"]},{"id":"bcf71a239bbaaf8d","term":"마당","zh":"院子，庭院","audio":"/audio/bcf71a239bbaaf8d1e52.mp3","entryId":"15687","definition":"房子附带着的平整的空地。","pronunciation":["마당"]},{"id":"2cb37f504898faa6","term":"나비","zh":"蝴蝶","audio":"/audio/2cb37f504898faa6fd3f.mp3","entryId":"38882","definition":"一种昆虫，身躯细长，长着一对带有漂亮纹路的宽大的翅膀，用长长的管状口器吸食花蜜为生。","pronunciation":["나비"]},{"id":"1af2aeb1be04021c","term":"많이","zh":"多","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3","entryId":"66030","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准地。","pronunciation":["마ː니"]},{"id":"6d5224f45d00d6a1","term":"날아들다","zh":"飞来，飞进","audio":"/audio/6d5224f45d00d6a1d8c0.mp3","entryId":"40855","definition":"飞过来进到里面。","pronunciation":["나라들다"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","ter